{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Ultimate cute clicker game is back and even cuter than ever!\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cKawaii Clicker Reborn\u201d is a clicker game where you produce hearts alongside cute characters.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the screen to fill the gauge and enter \u201cFever Mode\u201d to get a production power bonus and collect tons of hearts!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the hearts you've collected to purchase mysterious items and produce even more hearts!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click away to watch the cute animations of the adorable characters!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill the world with the ultimate cuteness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944020/extras/0551cda57218a47ff7dfb26d0ab68a1e.poster.avif?t=1772520876\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944020/extras/0551cda57218a47ff7dfb26d0ab68a1e.webm?t=1772520876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944020/extras/0551cda57218a47ff7dfb26d0ab68a1e.mp4?t=1772520876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Fever Mode\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal Fever: Strong bonus to heart production power and click production power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra Fever: Super strong production power bonus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click Fever: Bonus to productivity with consecutive clicks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gatling Fever: Bonus to item production power for every 6 clicks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin Fever: Spin the magic circle! Earn a large number of hearts for every spin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slot Fever: Earn a large number of hearts by matching three numbers in the slot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster Fever: Defeat monsters with your friends! Click to attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Mini-games\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm: Spend hearts to grow crops and harvest them. Crops will strengthen your productivity while growing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bingo: Draw numbers to get bingo numbers! Chance to get a lot of hearts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reincarnation: A strong new game! Strengthen your production power and click more efficiently!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Appeal Points\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mixes traditional clicker game style with cute character animation </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchasing upgrades dramatically increases heart production </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cFever Mode\u201d gives you a chance to get a lot of hearts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw the \u201cUltra Fever Mode\u201d to get even more hearts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944020/extras/2dda57a0c4089011fb7819fb464dce87.poster.avif?t=1772520876\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944020/extras/2dda57a0c4089011fb7819fb464dce87.webm?t=1772520876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944020/extras/2dda57a0c4089011fb7819fb464dce87.mp4?t=1772520876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Heart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3944020/f3fd767d5d15e0cbcf408ac66723ed48ca8c9d37.jpg"},{"name":"Small Handprints","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3944020/23d4319fc6